## Goal
Perform a principal component analysis (PCA) of the gene count matrix to visualize the primary sources of variation in the bulk RNA-seq data. The analysis will project samples into PCA space and colour the points by condition (untreated vs treated) to assess the dominant patterns of gene expression variation across the six samples.

